# Commits git blame should skip: bulk reformats and nothing else.
#
# Empty on purpose. Formatting lands by ratchet
# (`cd frontend-v2 && npm run format:changed`), so no commit in this repo's
# history is a pure reformat and there is nothing yet to skip. The file exists
# so that if a tree-wide `biome format --write` ever does land, its sha has a
# home and blame keeps working the same day rather than a year later.
#
# Turn it on for your clone with:
#
#     git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub and Forgejo both honour the file without that step.
#
# One sha per line, full 40 characters, with a comment saying what it was.
